"These apps can't be given a second window on the desktop you're on because macOS doesn't allow it. Default is to show a warning. “Move it to this desktop” brings the app's existing windows over to the desktop you're on (its windows follow, nothing is quit). It's marked experimental because it uses an undocumented system interface, so it may stop working on a future macOS version. “Quit there and reopen here” quits the app and relaunches it here, which works but loses anything unsaved or playing." = "这些应用无法在你所在的桌面打开第二个窗口，因为 macOS 不允许。默认显示警告。「搬到本桌面」会把该应用已有的窗口搬到你现在所在的桌面（窗口跟着过来，不会退出应用）。它标注为实验性：底层使用未公开的系统接口，可能在未来的 macOS 版本上失效。「退出后在本桌面重开」会退出应用并在此重开，可用但会丢失未保存或正在播放的内容。";
"Thick (3)" = "粗 （3）";
"Thickness of a border drawn around the whole bar, in points (None leaves the bar borderless). Separate from the running-app box." = "整个程序坞的边框宽度，单位为点。选择“无”则不绘制边框；此设置独立于运行中应用的边框。";
"Thickness of the running-app outline, in points." = "运行状态边框的宽度，单位为点。";
"Thin (1)" = "细 （1）";
"This clears Powerspaces' Accessibility approval from macOS, then relaunches the app so you can grant it fresh. Use it when you've enabled Accessibility but window actions still say it's missing, usually after rebuilding or reinstalling.\n\nAfter the relaunch, switch Powerspaces back on in System Settings ▸ Privacy & Security ▸ Accessibility." = "这将清除 PowerSpaces 的辅助功能授权并重新启动，以便重新授权。适用于已开启权限却仍提示权限缺失的情况，常见于重新构建或安装后。\n\n重启后，请前往系统设置 ▸ 隐私与安全性 ▸ 辅助功能，重新开启 PowerSpaces。";
"This copies the powerspaces command-line tool into ~/.local/bin in your home folder. No admin password and no Terminal — it's a plain file copy." = "这会将命令行工具复制到个人目录 ~/.local/bin，无需管理员密码，也不会打开终端。";
"This desktop" = "当前桌面";
"This opens a Terminal window and installs AltTab — a free, open-source app — using Homebrew. Homebrew may ask for your password." = "这将打开终端并通过 Homebrew 安装免费的开源工具 AltTab。Homebrew 可能要求输入密码。";
"This opens a Terminal window and uses sudo to copy the powerspaces tool into /usr/local/bin, so it works in every shell. macOS will ask for your admin password." = "这会打开终端并通过 sudo 将 powerspaces 工具复制到 /usr/local/bin。macOS 会要求输入管理员密码。";
"This opens nodejs.org in your browser, where you can download and install Node.js (it includes npm). Powerspaces doesn't install it for you." = "这将在浏览器中打开 nodejs.org，你可以自行下载并安装 Node.js（包含 npm）。PowerSpaces 不会代为安装。";
"This sets AltTab to show only the windows on the desktop you're on (the active Space). AltTab quits and relaunches to apply it.\n\nTo make ⌘-Tab open it (replacing the macOS app switcher), there's one manual step AltTab only lets you set in its own settings: AltTab ▸ Settings ▸ Controls → set the hold shortcut to ⌘. Powerspaces can't set that for you reliably, since it's stored in a format only AltTab can write." = "这会让 AltTab 仅显示当前桌面的窗口，并重启 AltTab 以应用设置。\n\n要用 ⌘-Tab 打开 AltTab，请在 AltTab ▸ Settings ▸ Controls 中将按住的快捷键设为 ⌘。该快捷键的存储格式只能由 AltTab 自身可靠地写入，因此需要手动设置。";
"This uninstalls Powerspaces and quits.%@\n\nQuitting restores Apple's Dock and your “Move left/right a space” shortcut, and removes the login item and the Accessibility permission.\n\nYour settings (preferences, pinned apps, and per-app rules) live at %@:\n  •  Keep My Settings: leaves them there, so reinstalling Powerspaces restores everything exactly as it is now.\n  •  Delete Everything: also erases that folder. ⚠︎ Your preferences are deleted, and this can't be undone." = "这将卸载 PowerSpaces 并退出。%@\n\n退出时会恢复系统程序坞和“向左／右移动一个空间”快捷键，并移除登录项和辅助功能授权。\n\n设置（偏好、固定项和应用规则）位于 %@：\n  •  保留设置：保留该目录，重新安装后可恢复当前配置。\n  •  全部删除：同时删除该目录。⚠︎ 此操作不可撤销。";
"This will:\n• Install the powerspaces CLI to %@ (no admin needed).\n• Open Terminal to run “npm install” and import the extension into Raycast.\n\nThe Terminal window runs the steps automatically and stops on its own. When it shows the “DONE, safe to close” box, you can close it. No Terminal is needed after that." = "将执行：\n• 将命令行工具安装到 %@，无需管理员权限。\n• 打开终端，运行“npm install”并将扩展导入 Raycast。\n\n终端会自动执行并结束。显示“DONE, safe to close”后即可关闭；后续使用不需要终端。";
