"What the per-desktop dock does on a screen that's showing a full-screen app. Hide removes the bar (it can't be revealed); Auto-hide tucks it away but reveals it when the pointer reaches the edge; Show keeps it floating over the app." = "屏幕显示全屏应用时的程序坞行为。“隐藏”完全移除且无法唤出；“自动隐藏”在指针移到边缘时显示；“显示”始终悬浮在应用上方。";
