"When %@ is open on another desktop, this quits it entirely and relaunches it on the current one, the only reliable way to bring a single-window app here. Any unsaved or transient state in %@ is lost." = "当 %@ 已在其他桌面打开时，此操作会完全退出应用，再在当前桌面启动。这是目前将此类单窗口应用带到当前桌面的可用策略；%@ 中未保存的内容或临时状态会丢失。";
"When an app joins the dock (launched, pinned, or its first window opens here), grow the bar to open a slot and let the icon appear." = "应用加入程序坞时（启动、固定或在当前桌面打开首个窗口），先展开位置，再显示图标。";
