"When on, closing the last window of an app quits it, so it leaves ⌘-Tab and frees memory instead of lingering invisibly. Acts per app instance; minimizing never quits." = "开启后，关闭最后一个窗口会退出对应应用实例，使其离开 ⌘-Tab 并释放内存。最小化窗口不会导致退出。";
