"Whether AltTab is installed. Powerspaces uses it for the per-desktop ⌘-Tab switcher; it's a free, open-source app you install separately." = "AltTab 是用于仅切换当前桌面窗口的免费开源工具，需要单独安装。";
"Whether macOS currently lets Powerspaces control windows. Needed to close or minimize windows and read window titles." = "macOS 是否允许 PowerSpaces 控制窗口。关闭、最小化窗口和读取标题需要此权限。";
"Whether the powerspaces binary the extension calls is installed. “Install CLI” puts it in ~/.local/bin with no admin needed." = "扩展调用的 powerspaces 命令行工具是否已安装。“安装 CLI”会安装到 ~/.local/bin，无需管理员权限。";
