"Take over window layout commands and animate straight to the size that clears the dock, instead of maximising first and shrinking afterwards." = "接管窗口布局命令，直接动画到避开程序坞的尺寸，而不是先最大化再收缩。";
"Window layout" = "窗口布局";
"Covers Option-click on the green button, double-clicking a title bar, Fn-Control-F/R, and the layout items in the Window menu. Arrow keys are left to macOS. Full-screen and multi-window arrangements keep their system behaviour, and any command that cannot be identified with confidence is left to macOS." = "覆盖 Option＋绿色按钮、双击标题栏、Fn＋Control＋F（填充）与 Fn＋Control＋R（还原），以及「窗口」菜单中的布局项。方向键刻意交回 macOS：部分外接键盘在普通 Ctrl＋方向键上也会带上 Fn 标志，接管它会吞掉正常的切桌面操作。全屏与多窗口排列保持系统原有行为；无法可靠识别的命令一律交回 macOS 处理。";

// 多窗口应用的呈现方式（拆分 / 合并）。
"Multiple windows" = "多窗口应用";
"One icon per window" = "每个窗口一个图标";
"One icon per app" = "每个应用一个图标";
"One icon per window keeps a separate item for each window (named by its title when titles are on). One icon per app keeps a single item and shows the window count with dots instead." = "「每个窗口一个图标」为每个窗口保留独立图标（开启标题时以窗口标题命名）；「每个应用一个图标」只保留一个图标，窗口数量用圆点表示。";

// 跳转修饰键（按住点击直接跳到应用所在桌面）。
"Jump to the app's desktop" = "跳到应用所在桌面";
"Hold this key while clicking a dock icon to switch to the desktop the app is on instead of opening a window here. Only applies when the app's window is on another desktop." = "按住该键点击程序坞图标时，直接切换到应用所在的桌面，而不是在当前桌面新建窗口。仅在应用窗口位于其他桌面时生效。";
"Control only" = "仅 Control";

// 单实例应用在其他桌面时的「搬到本桌面」策略。
"Move it to this desktop" = "搬到本桌面";

// 「搬到本桌面」依赖未公开接口，界面上标注为实验性。
"Move it to this desktop (experimental)" = "搬到本桌面（实验性）";

// 激活应用时把它的窗口搬到当前桌面。
"Move an activated app's windows to this desktop" = "激活应用时把它的窗口搬到当前桌面";
"When an app is already running on another desktop, activating it (from Spotlight, the dock, or anywhere else) brings its windows to the desktop you're on instead of switching you over. Needs “When switching to an application, switch to a Space with open windows for the application” turned off in System Settings → Desktop & Dock → Mission Control, otherwise macOS switches first. Unlike the per-app “Move it to this desktop” strategy, this applies to every app automatically." = "应用已在其它桌面运行时，激活它（Spotlight、程序坞或任何方式）会把它的窗口搬到你现在所在的桌面，而不是把你切过去。需要先在系统设置 → 桌面与程序坞 → 调度中心里关闭「切换到应用程序时，切换到有打开窗口的空间」，否则 macOS 会先跳转。与按应用配置的「搬到本桌面」策略不同：这个对所有应用自动生效。";
"This needs “When switching to an application, switch to a Space with open windows for the application” turned off in System Settings, or apps will still switch to their own desktop." = "需要先在系统设置里关闭「切换到应用程序时，切换到有打开窗口的空间」，否则应用仍会跳转到它自己的桌面。";
"Open Desktop & Dock settings" = "打开「桌面与程序坞」设置";
